# Optional cloud AI keys. Copy this file to keys.txt (never commit keys.txt).
# ONE key per line, WITHOUT '#' in front:   provider:key
# Lines starting with '#' are ignored (like this one).
# Cloud AI stays OFF until you switch it on in Telegram: Settings -> Cloud AI.
#
# Examples (remove the '#' and put your real key):
# groq:gsk_your_key_here
# gemini:AIza_your_key_here
# CF_ACCOUNT_ID=your_cloudflare_account_id
# CF_API_TOKEN=your_cloudflare_token
